        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Parman — the night guard trapped in a place that should have stayed dead.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this abandoned school, silence doesn’t mean safety.<br>Parman has just been assigned as the night guard at a forgotten school — but something else lives here. His job sounds simple: <strong>guard the building, find a way out… and survive.</strong><br>But tonight, the school isn’t empty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Find 5 hidden keys to unlock the main gate.<br>👻 Face terrifying entities: the red kuntilanak, child ghosts, pocong, and more.<br>🕯️ Hide, run, or use sacred items to survive.<br>🔀 Every run is different — rooms and key locations are randomized each time you die.<br><br><strong>The closer you get to freedom, the harder they try to stop you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PARMAN</i> is a first-person survival horror game that throws you into the shadows of a haunted Indonesian school. Creepy whispers, bloodied walls, and unseen eyes watching your every move — the deeper you go, the more the school reveals its twisted secrets. This isn’t just about escaping.<br>It’s about facing what you lost… and finishing what was left undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.poster.avif?t=1765472438\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.webm?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.mp4?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive first-person horror gameplay</strong> with intense atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Indonesian ghosts</strong>: Red Kuntilanak, Pocong, Tuyul, and others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic level system</strong>: keys and encounters change with each death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival items</strong>: torch, prayer beads, food, batteries, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple cinematic endings</strong>: escape, or die being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.poster.avif?t=1765472438\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.webm?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/81ae0b3023ec1530f342737f3b447aa3.mp4?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.poster.avif?t=1765472438\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.webm?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/a57a7b7d9aeb820be5bc0ead0189520e.mp4?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming soon to PC — Prepare your nerves. You’re not alone in this school.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Parman — the night guard trapped in a place that should have stayed dead.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this abandoned school, silence doesn’t mean safety.<br>Parman has just been assigned as the night guard at a forgotten school — but something else lives here. His job sounds simple: <strong>guard the building, find a way out… and survive.</strong><br>But tonight, the school isn’t empty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Find 5 hidden keys to unlock the main gate.<br>👻 Face terrifying entities: the red kuntilanak, child ghosts, pocong, and more.<br>🕯️ Hide, run, or use sacred items to survive.<br>🔀 Every run is different — rooms and key locations are randomized each time you die.<br><br><strong>The closer you get to freedom, the harder they try to stop you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PARMAN</i> is a first-person survival horror game that throws you into the shadows of a haunted Indonesian school. Creepy whispers, bloodied walls, and unseen eyes watching your every move — the deeper you go, the more the school reveals its twisted secrets. This isn’t just about escaping.<br>It’s about facing what you lost… and finishing what was left undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.poster.avif?t=1765472438\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.webm?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791680/extras/39b3251f1c419796c7485db292f913d5.mp4?t=1765472438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap